# November 21, 2026: western Orange County, New York: the city of Port Jervis, the Town of Deerpark (Cuddebackville,
# Huguenot, Godeffroy), the city of Middletown and Slate Hill in the Town of Wawayanda. Drawn at random by
# tools/choose.py --state ny (region midh; it offered Middletown, which had no Atlas place, and the Atlas had nothing within
# 15 km of Port Jervis). Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py), HMdb marker pages, the
# Minisink Valley Historical Society (minisink.org), the William G. Pomeroy Foundation, Orange County tourism
# (pickocny.com), the Hudson River Valley Heritage Area, Trains and Railfan & Railroad magazines, the Pike County Courier,
# the Chronicle (Goshen), the River Reporter, a railroad photographer's blog, Grace Church and the Paramount Theatre,
# through tools/page.py. neversinkmuseum.org, orangetourism.org and thrall.org would not connect.
